FPLinux for @DEVICE@

Read docs/guides/STANDALONE.md before connecting the phone. It contains the
host requirements, USB setup, checksum, loader-first and reconnect procedures.
Hold * (asterisk) when the loader asks for the powered-off phone. The BootROM
key of this phone has not been confirmed.

This target starts Linux in RAM without a boot screen; the loader reports its
progress on the host. The phone is used through the USB SSH session. Display,
keypad, audio and Bluetooth support are not provided, and no feature has been
tested on this phone.

To end the session, disconnect USB. If a battery is installed, remove and
reinsert it before booting the phone normally.
